le to draw Nazrin cutely with ぐるぐる目 as a theme again? I'll leave everything up to you! Thank you very much!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@guminemi1003/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2696756, "client_id": 41262, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9eee8b8e/uploads/origins/c29380c9-25d5-4cc4-bafc-1177c9b95abf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1843655d68e8fce46abe757f87b38e89", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9eee8b8e/uploads/origins/c29380c9-25d5-4cc4-bafc-1177c9b95abf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=53d3eed87d3ec1df794beb76b1217fab", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\nあなたの好きな食べ物を楽しんでいるナズーリンを描いてください！\nありがとうございました！\n\nHello!\nPlease draw Nazrin enjoying any of your favorite foods!\nThank you very much!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@guminemi1003/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2696756, "client_id": 41262, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/61c8e77e/uploads/origins/9eb37781-248f-47ee-a857-3e8a67f69f02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0417e3bbbdaaada43b2902f8c49fbe2", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/61c8e77e/uploads/origins/9eb37781-248f-47ee-a857-3e8a67f69f02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0539de0f90a3b0c59a0131220b65271c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\nぐるぐる目をテーマにナズーリンを可愛く描いてくれませんか？\nお任せします！\nありがとうございました！\n\nHello!\nWould you be able to draw Nazrin cutely with ぐるぐる目 as a theme?\nI'll leave everything up to you!\nThank you very much!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@guminemi1003/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2696756, "client_id": 41262, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/39126c86/uploads/origins/098a67bf-f6f3-4a94-ab49-ff9a760aa105?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=451eb06d87ce50db2d7af0874ae11640", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/39126c86/uploads/origins/098a67bf-f6f3-4a94-ab49-ff9a760aa105?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5a3a923acde434bf3f37c8490eb6ae14", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\nナズーリンのイラスト、かわいいですね！\nリクエストなんですが、超かわいくて赤面してる表情のナズーリンを描いていただけませんか？\nすべてお任せします！\nありがとうございました！\n\nHello!\nYour Nazrin illustrations are so cute!\nFor my request, can you please draw Nazrin who has a super cute and blushing facial expression?\nI’ll leave everything up to you!\nThank you very much!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@guminemi1003/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2696756, "client_id": 359859, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0832b3d2/uploads/origins/f15ecbf9-56a9-424d-b927-5f3bc76767ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81d217e9996289bf2f62485d01588d52", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0832b3d2/uploads/origins/f15ecbf9-56a9-424d-b927-5f3bc76767ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=to